WEBVTT

00:00:10.190 --> 00:00:11.790
That's the center.

00:00:18.470 --> 00:00:20.520
Ark Cradle's center...

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:23.470
Is this Moment energy?

00:00:23.930 --> 00:00:25.350
Looks like it.

00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:27.620
What do we do now?

00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:32.890
Yusei and Team 5D's are here.

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:38.590
I'll welcome you to my castle Ark Cradle.

00:00:40.380 --> 00:00:40.920
What?

00:01:04.430 --> 00:01:06.100
Is everyone okay?

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:09.850
Don't let go!

00:01:10.050 --> 00:01:10.900
Jack!

00:01:10.900 --> 00:01:11.750
Everyone!

00:01:16.220 --> 00:01:18.270
Everyone is safe.

00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:20.260
However...

00:01:21.370 --> 00:01:24.000
We can't go together.

00:01:24.280 --> 00:01:27.190
Unbelievable.  What do we do?

00:01:27.820 --> 00:01:28.900
Look at this.

00:01:39.250 --> 00:01:40.240
What's this?

00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:43.270
I scanned Ark Cradle's interior.

00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:50.690
We're on three different paths that lead to 
three Yusei Gears that surround the Sun Gear.

00:01:52.010 --> 00:01:55.840
If we don't stop the Yusei 
Gears first, we can't

00:01:55.840 --> 00:01:59.920
give positive spin to the Moment 
that powers the Sun Gear.

00:02:00.510 --> 00:02:02.010
Yusei, there's no time.

00:02:02.350 --> 00:02:06.340
If we don't hurry, Ark Cradle is 
going to fall on Neo Domino City.

00:02:06.880 --> 00:02:07.990
Everyone, listen!

00:02:07.990 --> 00:02:12.710
We're splitting into three teams, and 
we'll each go to a different Gear.

00:02:18.230 --> 00:02:19.930
I believe in you.

00:02:19.930 --> 00:02:23.250
I know we'll reunite at the Sun Gear!

00:02:24.810 --> 00:02:25.770
Jack?

00:02:26.290 --> 00:02:28.500
Didn't you hear Yusei?

00:02:28.860 --> 00:02:31.000
We have to fulfill our mission.

00:02:31.440 --> 00:02:34.450
Neo Domino City is on the 
brink of destruction!

00:02:35.240 --> 00:02:36.430
Jack!

00:02:36.750 --> 00:02:37.530
Let's go!

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:39.750
Yeah!

00:02:39.750 --> 00:02:40.990
We're going too!

00:02:43.190 --> 00:02:44.280
Yusei!

00:02:45.680 --> 00:02:48.930
Fine, but you also better be careful.

00:02:49.220 --> 00:02:51.140
You better not die!

00:02:53.450 --> 00:02:55.400
We'll wait for you at the Sun Gear.

00:02:58.870 --> 00:03:00.680
I'm counting on you!

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:11.540
It's just as you said.

00:03:11.760 --> 00:03:14.270
They came here.

00:03:14.690 --> 00:03:16.790
I promise to stop them.

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:20.740
Your plans for the future 
will proceed as scheduled.

00:03:23.230 --> 00:03:26.940
In exchange, you must fulfill your promise.

00:03:27.200 --> 00:03:29.490
Yes, of course.

00:03:36.740 --> 00:03:38.300
Riding Duels.

00:03:38.660 --> 00:03:41.350
These duels evolved in the world of speed.

00:03:41.670 --> 00:03:48.250
The people with the legendary marks who 
risked their lives were known as 5D's.

00:03:50.170 --> 00:03:55.950
Run!  The road of evolution 
leading to tomorrow

00:03:56.250 --> 00:04:00.320
Is a new legendary duel

00:04:12.800 --> 00:04:17.400
Throw away all feelings of failure

00:04:18.370 --> 00:04:23.040
Set free your infinite potential

00:04:23.410 --> 00:04:28.480
Every beginning is up to you

00:04:29.010 --> 00:04:34.990
Everyone is lost  Pursue the light

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:40.360
Losing sight of fleeting dreams

00:04:40.930 --> 00:04:46.200
Connect the bond and you'll never lose

00:04:48.470 --> 00:04:53.970
Become the gale and dance  
Cut through the darkness

00:04:54.270 --> 00:04:59.340
Even if you can't see your destination

00:04:59.540 --> 00:05:04.880
Run on your feet without fear

00:05:05.120 --> 00:05:10.420
On this road that leads to tomorrow

00:05:10.860 --> 00:05:17.460
Going my way!!  Break through and go!

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:27.740
Illusion Field!
Ecole de Zone

00:05:39.080 --> 00:05:40.340
I see it.

00:05:40.340 --> 00:05:41.110
Yeah.

00:05:59.170 --> 00:06:01.320
This is the Yusei Gear.

00:06:01.440 --> 00:06:02.770
Looks like it.

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:07.570
Too bad, but you won't go any further.

00:06:07.830 --> 00:06:08.780
Sherry!

00:06:08.780 --> 00:06:10.260
Why are you here?

00:06:10.770 --> 00:06:13.140
I'm on Z-one's side.

00:06:13.590 --> 00:06:17.000
I won't let you stop Ark Cradle from falling.

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:18.130
What?

00:06:18.420 --> 00:06:23.230
You always said that you would get revenge 
against Iliaster for your parents!

00:06:23.240 --> 00:06:28.240
That's right!  Do you think your parents 
will be happy with what you're doing?

00:06:28.700 --> 00:06:30.970
This has nothing to do with you.

00:06:35.690 --> 00:06:38.410
This is...  Why do you have it?

00:06:38.580 --> 00:06:41.180
Mizoguchi asked me to give it to you.

00:06:41.180 --> 00:06:44.110
Isn't that a memento from your father?

00:06:45.690 --> 00:06:49.660
That's right.  Everything 
started with this card.

00:06:51.290 --> 00:06:54.490
My peaceful life was suddenly 
destroyed that day.

00:06:54.930 --> 00:07:00.610
After that day, I risked everything 
to get revenge for my parents.

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:07.520
However, I can no longer 
get revenge for my parents.

00:07:09.090 --> 00:07:13.430
I dedicated my whole life for revenge, 
so what do I do from now on?

00:07:15.610 --> 00:07:16.830
Sherry...

00:07:17.210 --> 00:07:18.820
But there was a god.

00:07:19.060 --> 00:07:23.210
After I lost everything, Z-one 
gave me the hope to live.

00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:24.730
Hope to live?

00:07:24.920 --> 00:07:27.660
Sherry, what did Z-one say to you?

00:07:27.660 --> 00:07:30.640
It's simple.  We made a deal.

00:07:31.140 --> 00:07:36.330
If I help Z-one, he will grant me one wish.

00:07:36.330 --> 00:07:38.960
What did you ask for?

00:07:39.090 --> 00:07:41.770
Wouldn't you like to know.

00:07:41.770 --> 00:07:43.280
Sherry, listen.

00:07:43.640 --> 00:07:47.510
As we're talking, Ark Cradle is falling.

00:07:47.650 --> 00:07:53.880
Are you willing to put many lives in 
danger for your wish to be granted?

00:07:54.380 --> 00:07:57.250
No matter what you say, 
I won't change my mind.

00:07:57.480 --> 00:08:00.850
And I don't need this card anymore.

00:08:01.270 --> 00:08:04.100
That's important to you!

00:08:04.100 --> 00:08:05.760
You should have it!

00:08:06.180 --> 00:08:09.330
Do you really want to help your enemy?

00:08:10.020 --> 00:08:13.030
You know how powerful this card is.

00:08:13.690 --> 00:08:16.880
Its power might defeat you.

00:08:17.150 --> 00:08:20.240
It doesn't matter.  I made 
a promise with Mizoguchi!

00:08:20.240 --> 00:08:21.070
I see.

00:08:28.290 --> 00:08:32.410
The Yusei Gear's operation device 
is directly connected to my life.

00:08:32.860 --> 00:08:37.390
If you don't defeat me, you 
can't stop the Yusei Gear!

00:08:37.680 --> 00:08:38.840
Sherry...

00:08:41.180 --> 00:08:42.360
We have no choice.

00:08:43.470 --> 00:08:44.380
Duel!

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:47.010
I'll go first!  My turn!

00:08:49.790 --> 00:08:53.150
I activate the Field Spell Ecole de Zone.

00:08:53.700 --> 00:08:57.780
No player can attack directly on this field.

00:09:00.330 --> 00:09:03.560
I'll fight you both at the same time.

00:09:05.510 --> 00:09:06.460
What?

00:09:06.460 --> 00:09:07.980
There are two Sherrys?

00:09:08.390 --> 00:09:10.290
Aki!

00:09:10.840 --> 00:09:12.080
Aki!

00:09:13.450 --> 00:09:14.670
Crow!

00:09:16.240 --> 00:09:18.530
Welcome to my field.

00:09:35.950 --> 00:09:38.260
Sherry, where am I?

00:09:38.260 --> 00:09:39.430
Where's Aki?

00:09:39.900 --> 00:09:43.300
This is Ecole de Zone's field effect.

00:09:44.240 --> 00:09:48.560
You'll fight the two of 
us on separate fields!

00:09:51.080 --> 00:09:52.370
I end my turn.

00:09:57.050 --> 00:10:00.950
Sherry, I guess I really have to fight you.

00:10:01.910 --> 00:10:03.330
My turn!

00:10:03.520 --> 00:10:06.550
I summon Twilight Rose Knight.

00:10:14.700 --> 00:10:15.490
What?

00:10:16.210 --> 00:10:20.750
My monster changed into a Monster 
Token with the same attack points?

00:10:21.130 --> 00:10:23.790
What's going on in this field?

00:10:26.490 --> 00:10:27.870
I end my turn.

00:10:28.510 --> 00:10:31.060
I summon Mask Token!

00:10:33.980 --> 00:10:35.300
I end my turn.

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:42.450
What's going on?

00:10:42.450 --> 00:10:44.630
You're using weird magic!

00:10:44.630 --> 00:10:46.560
You won't stop me here!

00:10:46.820 --> 00:10:48.080
My turn!

00:10:48.910 --> 00:10:54.530
Good!  I can Special Summon Blackwing - Bora 
the Spear if I have a Blackwing on my field.

00:10:54.530 --> 00:10:58.060
I'll summon two monsters at once!

00:10:58.210 --> 00:11:01.340
I summon Blackwing - Kochi the Daybreak!

00:11:03.490 --> 00:11:04.440
Next-

00:11:04.830 --> 00:11:05.670
What?

00:11:09.730 --> 00:11:14.280
This is the same Monster 
Token that Sherry summoned.

00:11:16.690 --> 00:11:20.330
Damn!  I can't use my Blackwing combo!

00:11:20.750 --> 00:11:23.620
I set one card and end my turn!

00:11:28.850 --> 00:11:31.560
I summon Mask Token!

00:11:33.350 --> 00:11:35.870
I set one card and end my turn.

00:11:37.360 --> 00:11:38.540
My turn!

00:11:39.840 --> 00:11:44.960
Sherry summoned the same Monster Token as 
mine, but it has different attack points.

00:11:45.670 --> 00:11:52.570
In that case, I tribute Monster Token 
to Tribute Summon Rose Tentacles!

00:12:01.800 --> 00:12:06.100
This field stops the monster 
summoning, and a Monster

00:12:06.100 --> 00:12:10.460
Token with the same attack 
points is summoned instead.

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:18.680
But my Monster Token has much more attack 
points than Sherry's Monster Token.

00:12:19.010 --> 00:12:19.650
Battle!

00:12:26.330 --> 00:12:27.590
I end my turn!

00:12:27.920 --> 00:12:29.210
My turn!

00:12:29.670 --> 00:12:35.370
I tribute Mask Token to Tribute 
Summon a new Mask Token!

00:12:39.040 --> 00:12:39.710
Battle!

00:12:45.620 --> 00:12:46.820
I end my turn.

00:12:51.590 --> 00:12:52.620
My turn!

00:12:52.940 --> 00:12:57.150
Sherry only summons Monster 
Tokens, just like me.

00:12:57.370 --> 00:13:02.320
No matter what we summon on this 
field, it becomes a Monster Token.

00:13:04.190 --> 00:13:06.100
That means I can't Synchro Summon.

00:13:06.340 --> 00:13:09.870
I can't use my Blackwings' powers?

00:13:12.090 --> 00:13:12.990
Wait a second.

00:13:13.540 --> 00:13:16.090
Even in this situation, if I use this...

00:13:17.740 --> 00:13:21.240
I summon Blackwing - Bora the Spear!

00:13:29.960 --> 00:13:33.460
All right!  Since Bora the 
Spear was destroyed, I can

00:13:33.460 --> 00:13:38.350
Special Summon Blackwing - Kogarashi 
the Wanderer from my hand!

00:13:42.120 --> 00:13:46.440
Since Kogarashi the Wanderer was Special 
Summoned, your effect can't stop it!

00:13:46.440 --> 00:13:49.370
It doesn't become a Monster Token!

00:13:53.510 --> 00:13:54.610
How's that, Sherry?

00:13:54.610 --> 00:13:59.140
You can't seal away my 
Blackwings that easily!

00:14:00.130 --> 00:14:02.750
I activate my trap Fleur de Vertiges!

00:14:03.570 --> 00:14:08.720
When you Special Summon a monster, 
that monster is removed from play!

00:14:13.040 --> 00:14:13.520
What?

00:14:13.520 --> 00:14:16.320
Kogarashi the Wanderer is removed from play?

00:14:16.330 --> 00:14:17.820
I won't let that happen!

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:20.470
I activate my Counter Trap Down Force!

00:14:20.680 --> 00:14:27.930
If your card's effect makes my monster leave 
the field, that effect is negated and destroyed!

00:14:30.550 --> 00:14:32.320
All right!  Battle!

00:14:32.620 --> 00:14:35.650
Kogarashi the Wanderer 
attacks the Monster Token!

00:14:37.630 --> 00:14:39.780
I activate my trap High Half!

00:14:40.680 --> 00:14:45.750
A monster with at least 2000 attack points 
has its attack points cut in half!

00:14:56.850 --> 00:14:59.640
What just happened?

00:15:01.420 --> 00:15:05.640
The first trap's effect tried to 
remove my Blackwing from play.

00:15:07.770 --> 00:15:12.890
The second effect lowered Sherry's 
monster's attack points.

00:15:14.080 --> 00:15:17.300
Why would she want to take more damage?

00:15:20.470 --> 00:15:21.510
Can it be?

00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:26.110
If what she's doing is possible, 
there's only one solution!

00:15:26.740 --> 00:15:30.710
But there's no way I can 
confirm what's happening.

00:15:31.160 --> 00:15:32.580
But Aki can.

00:15:33.410 --> 00:15:36.770
Aki, please figure it out!

00:15:38.560 --> 00:15:39.720
I end my turn!

00:15:56.230 --> 00:16:00.400
Sherry, why do you have a Blackwing?

00:16:07.820 --> 00:16:10.940
Sherry, why do you have a Blackwing?

00:16:14.100 --> 00:16:18.790
No matter how hard you try, you 
can't escape from this field.

00:16:19.260 --> 00:16:21.940
I activate the spell card Imitation!

00:16:23.280 --> 00:16:29.920
This card copies a Token and 
Special Summons it on your field.

00:16:30.650 --> 00:16:35.750
And you take damage equal to 
half that Token's attack points.

00:16:49.600 --> 00:16:52.350
Where did that effect come from?

00:16:53.690 --> 00:16:55.790
The same thing happened recently.

00:16:56.420 --> 00:17:01.260
Is someone else meddling in this duel?

00:17:10.200 --> 00:17:14.560
You'll fight the two of 
us on separate fields!

00:17:16.270 --> 00:17:19.180
Sherry, you're a liar.

00:17:20.910 --> 00:17:25.900
You may have figured something 
out, but you can't escape!

00:17:26.620 --> 00:17:30.850
Sherry, you underestimate the 5D's bond.

00:17:31.400 --> 00:17:34.350
Kogarashi the Wanderer has another effect.

00:17:35.140 --> 00:17:36.310
My turn!

00:17:36.600 --> 00:17:41.950
Level 6 Kogarashi the Wanderer 
tunes Level 1 Monster Token!

00:17:43.370 --> 00:17:46.440
What?  You're tuning with a 
monster on the opponent's field?

00:17:46.440 --> 00:17:52.430
Due to Kogarashi the Wanderer's effect, 
I can use it as Synchro Material!

00:17:53.380 --> 00:17:56.060
The cold flame envelops the entire world.

00:17:56.380 --> 00:17:58.380
Black flower, bloom!

00:17:58.850 --> 00:18:00.320
Synchro Summon!

00:18:00.550 --> 00:18:03.280
Appear, Black Rose Dragon!

00:18:06.730 --> 00:18:07.750
It's no use.

00:18:07.750 --> 00:18:10.350
When Kogarashi the Wanderer is used as

00:18:10.500 --> 00:18:13.570
Synchro Material, the Synchro 
Summon can't be negated!

00:18:15.530 --> 00:18:22.030
When Black Rose Dragon is successfully Synchro 
Summoned, all cards on the field are destroyed!

00:18:22.310 --> 00:18:24.680
Go, Black Rose Gale!

00:18:36.220 --> 00:18:39.450
Your field is gone, Sherry.

00:18:39.720 --> 00:18:40.690
What?

00:18:50.080 --> 00:18:52.490
All right!  You did it, Aki!

00:18:56.280 --> 00:18:57.360
Crow!

00:18:57.360 --> 00:18:58.300
Aki!

00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:12.470
We almost destroyed each 
other by mistake, Sherry!

00:19:14.050 --> 00:19:20.770
In the beginning, you made it seem like we 
were battling you in two separate duels.

00:19:22.630 --> 00:19:25.670
But that was a complete lie.

00:19:26.820 --> 00:19:30.710
You made us think that we 
were in separate duels, but

00:19:31.270 --> 00:19:37.160
we were actually battling in 
a three-person battle royale.

00:19:41.020 --> 00:19:44.720
That was cheating!

00:19:46.470 --> 00:19:48.430
I'm impressed that you figured it out.

00:19:48.610 --> 00:19:51.840
I knew Aki would figure it out!

00:19:51.840 --> 00:19:52.650
Yeah.

00:19:53.150 --> 00:19:55.320
Thanks to Yusei.

00:19:58.400 --> 00:19:59.600
Everyone, listen.

00:20:00.290 --> 00:20:04.470
There's something we need to 
do to win the team battles.

00:20:04.470 --> 00:20:05.870
What do you mean?

00:20:06.780 --> 00:20:08.410
Let me see your decks.

00:20:10.430 --> 00:20:13.150
Teamwork will be important.

00:20:13.560 --> 00:20:17.320
We need to memorize the contents 
of each others' decks.

00:20:17.490 --> 00:20:19.630
I see!  If we do that...

00:20:19.630 --> 00:20:24.150
In a team battle, we're allowed to use 
the cards that a teammate left behind.

00:20:25.460 --> 00:20:32.100
Since then, we studied hard to learn all 
our teammates' traps and monster effects.

00:20:32.100 --> 00:20:41.220
Even though we can't hear or see it, Yusei 
taught us that Team 5D's bond can never be severed!

00:20:46.720 --> 00:20:47.880
What's so funny?

00:20:48.400 --> 00:20:51.740
Congratulations for solving my trap.

00:20:51.860 --> 00:20:57.030
But that leads to the true threat.

00:20:57.030 --> 00:20:58.200
What do you mean?

00:20:58.590 --> 00:21:00.430
You didn't notice?

00:21:00.430 --> 00:21:06.980
Your Black Rose Dragon's effect destroyed 
Z-ONE that I had set on my field.

00:21:11.400 --> 00:21:15.290
This card activates when it's 
destroyed and sent to the graveyard.

00:21:15.290 --> 00:21:19.280
I activate the spell card Z-ONE's 
effect from my graveyard!

00:21:28.550 --> 00:21:35.050
I'll use the power of the card that 
my father left me to bury you!

00:21:55.990 --> 00:22:01.200
If the world is endless, prove it to my heart

00:22:01.300 --> 00:22:06.540
If we shed the same tears, 
let's laugh together

00:22:06.670 --> 00:22:11.910
Freed reality forms phrases 
in the piercing beat

00:22:12.040 --> 00:22:14.650
Our hearts resonate

00:22:14.650 --> 00:22:19.880
As the nameless flower blooms with sound

00:22:20.020 --> 00:22:26.520
We'll find a place for us

00:22:28.430 --> 00:22:33.300
Waking in a dream  Stretch 
our hands toward the future

00:22:33.300 --> 00:22:38.340
Grab and release repeatedly as we search

00:22:39.070 --> 00:22:44.510
Repaint the darkness with 
the colors we envision

00:22:44.510 --> 00:22:53.080
Overlaying memories, bonds 
and hope creates future color

00:22:53.080 --> 00:22:58.690
We will draw it forever
